WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:05.028
To multiply a bigger number, split it into tens and ones.

00:05.478 --> 00:10.842
Thirty-four is thirty plus four. We multiply each part by six.

00:11.292 --> 00:14.426
Thirty times six is one hundred eighty.

00:14.876 --> 00:17.593
Four times six is twenty-four.

00:18.043 --> 00:24.173
Add the two parts. One hundred eighty plus twenty-four makes two hundred four.

00:24.623 --> 00:30.547
Try another one. Twenty-five times three is twenty times three, which is sixty,

00:30.547 --> 00:35.420
plus five times three, which is fifteen. That makes seventy-five.
